SOAPBOX: Very hard contest weekend!
SOAPBOX: The low bands were extremely noisy, especially 80m. It was very difficult to decode many calls, and at times I felt like I was listening with the wrong beverage antenna. Rain all weekend, plus a few power cuts and restarts, made things even more interesting 🙂
SOAPBOX: High bands were another world – much better conditions there. Had fun playing 2BSIQ!
SOAPBOX: My daughter joked: “Dad, this shouldn’t be a typing competition!” 😄
SOAPBOX: Congratulations to P49X for the great score, and also to ED8M – the fastest catcher on all bands!
SOAPBOX: Sorry if I missed or lost anyone in the conditions — will try to catch you next time.
SOAPBOX: CUAGN in ARRL CW.
SOAPBOX: 73!
SOAPBOX: Andy / C4E (ex. H25A)
